sode-301-chronicles-of-darkness-the-ultimate-evil-institutionalized-chapter-4/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-301-chronicles-of-darkness-the-ultimate-evil-institutionalized-chapter-4/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Three months after the licenses are stamped and the shingle goes up for Dakota Investigative Services, winter settles hard over the plains&mdash;and over old wounds. One of the crew retreats to the edge of the reservation, seeking quiet and control, but the past doesn&rsquo;t ask permission. A late-morning knock brings a familiar name, frayed by grief and fury, and an elder&rsquo;s counsel forces a choice: keep surviving, or start healing. In the hush between snowfall and sunrise, the fight against the unseen takes a breath&mdash;and a new direction. About the Chronicle The Ultimate Evil is a Chronicles of Darkness story about the corruption that festers beneath faith, friendship, and forgotten memories. Set against the stark landscape of North Dakota in the late 1980s, it follows four men bound by tragedy and obsession as they confront the satanic rot infecting their community&mdash;and the cost of staring too long into its abyss. \ud83d\udde8\ufe0f Hop into our Discord! Love the stories? Want to chat with the storyteller and players? Or maybe you're just looking for a place to geek out about tabletop roleplaying games? Whether you're a seasoned GM, a curious newbie, or just love hearing epic tales unfold, our community is the perfect place to hang out, ask questions, share your own adventures, and connect with fellow TTRPG fans. Come say hi&mdash;we&rsquo;d love to meet you! \ud83d\udc49 https://discord.gg/T9zeN9p Follow Us X: https://x.com/Twin_Cities_VtM Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/TwinCitiesByNight/ iTunes: https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/twin-cities-by-night/id1246523585?mt=2 SoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBUyj7h-xIhwsM3kHK56SRA &nbs